    4, 0, '0x10C4', '0xEA60', true, 'Classic NodeMCU v2 Amica ESP-12E (ESP8266EX) Wi-Fi 4 development board with 4MB Flash, CP2102 Micro-USB bridge, and D0–D8 headers. Safe relay/sensor GPIOs: D1 (GPIO5), D2 (GPIO4), D5 (GPIO14), D6 (GPIO12), D7 (GPIO13).',
